
Before (Full Custodial)
	•	All operations used server-side private keys
	•	Enhanced inference service handled compute server-side
	•	Users didn't need wallets for AI interactions
	•	Platform controlled all blockchain transactions
After (Hybrid Architecture)
	•	Compute Operations: Non-custodial (user wallet required)
	◦	AI chat uses direct provider communication via client broker
	◦	Ledger account management through connected wallet
	◦	Provider acknowledgment via client signatures
	•	Storage Operations: Custodial (platform managed)
	◦	Dataset uploads remain seamless without wallet signatures
	◦	Agent metadata encryption/decryption server-side
Key Implementation Details
Client-Side Broker System
	•	Singleton Pattern: clientBroker.ts with address-based caching
	•	BrowserProvider Integration: Uses injected wallet (MetaMask/WalletConnect)
	•	Automatic Reinitialization: Handles wallet address changes gracefully
