Migration Strategy
This PR implements a minimal-change approachfocused on:
	•	Surgical removal of custodial compute components
	•	Addition of client-side compute infrastructure
	•	Preservation of storage custodial functionality
	•	Comprehensive error handling and user guidance
The platform is now ready for production deployment with the new hybrid architecture, providing users with the security benefits of non-custodial compute while maintaining the UX benefits of custodial storage.

